# MAS v20 Architecture - Mermaid Diagram

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph MAS["MAS Orchestrator v20"]
        LLM["LLM Client<br/>MiniMax API"]
        
        subgraph IMO["IMO Solver (v19 Style)"]
            Detector["IMOTechniqueDetector"]
            IMO_Solver["IMOSolverV22"]
            IMO_Scorer["EnhancedMathScorer"]
        end
        
        subgraph SWE["SWE Solver (v20 Style)"]
            SWE_Solver["SWESolverV22"]
            SWE_Scorer["EnhancedSWEScorer"]
        end
        
        subgraph Others["Other Solvers (v14)"]
            ARC["solve_arc_real"]
            BBEH["solve_bbeh"]
            HLE["solve_hle"]
            MATH["solve_math"]
            GPQA["solve_gpqa"]
            OS["solve_osworld"]
            Zero["solve_zerobench"]
        end
    end
    
    LLM --> Detector
    LLM --> SWE_Solver
    LLM --> ARC
    LLM --> BBEH
    LLM --> HLE
    LLM --> MATH
    LLM --> GPQA
    LLM --> OS
    LLM --> Zero
    
    Detector --> IMO_Solver
    IMO_Solver --> IMO_Scorer
    
    SWE_Solver --> SWE_Scorer
    
    style LLM fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style IMO_Scorer fill:#9f9,stroke:#333
    style SWE_Scorer fill:#9f9,stroke:#333
    style Detector fill:#ff9,stroke:#333
```

